### =====================================================
### Customer/delete - Test Cases
### NOTA: el endpoint ahora es [HttpPost] (antes HttpDelete)
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Eliminar cliente por customerId — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Customer/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 126
}

### Test 2: Eliminar cliente por privateCode (filtro alterno) — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Customer/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "privateCode": "CEMACO-TEST"
}

### Test 3: Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Customer/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 126
}

### Test 4: Validación - sin customerId ni privateCode → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Customer/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### Test 5: Cliente inexistente → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/Customer/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 999999999
}
